{"notice_id":23839918,"sections":[{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"BT-120-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-131(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-04-08T10:00:00+02:00"},{"field_id":"BT-132(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-04-08T10:00:00+02:00"},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"code":"allowed","field_id":"BT-17-Lot","list":"esubmission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-18-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https://www.subreport.de/E65862233"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Ausschreibung der Glasreinigung"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"E65862233"},{"code":"services","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zur Beschaffung der Glasreinigungsleistungen wird ein Offenes Verfahren gem. VgV durchgeführt. \nDas Klinikum Esslingen beabsichtigt die Leistung der Glasreinigung beginnend ab dem 01.06.2024 an einen Dienstleister zu vergeben. Die gegenständlichen Leistungen sind in der Leistungsbeschreibung und ihrer Anlagen zu diesen Vergabeunterlagen niedergeschrieben. \nDie Unterlagen sind verpflichtender Leistungsbestandteil."},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-63-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-726-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"required","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"late-all","field_id":"BT-771-Lot","list":"missing-info-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Das Angebot muss vollständig sein. Unvollständige Angebote werden ausgeschlossen, sofern eine Nachforderung nicht zulässig ist."},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-97-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":3.0},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Es wird darauf hingewiesen, dass bei Beanstandungen im Hinblick auf das hiesige Vergabe-verfahren die Bewerber Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die sie erkannt haben, gegen-über der Vergabestelle innerhalb von 10 Kalendertagen zu rügen haben und weiterhin Ver-stöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die erst im Vergabeverfahren erkennbar sind, von den Be-werbern spätestens bis zum Ablauf der Frist zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber der Vergabestel-le zu rügen sind (vgl. § 160 Abs. 3 Satz 1 Nr. 1, 2 und Nr. 3 GWB), damit die Bewerber für den Fall, dass der Rüge nicht abgeholfen wird, ein Nachprüfungsverfahren vor der Vergabekam-mer anstreben können. \n\nSofern die Vergabestelle einer Rüge nicht abhilft, kann der betreffende Bewerber nur innerhalb von längstens 15 Kalendertagen nach Eingang des Antwortschreibens an den Rügenden diesbezüglich ein Nachprüfungsverfahren vor der Vergabekammer einleiten (vgl. § 160 Abs. 3 Satz 1 Nr. 4 GWB). Fristen für die Einlegung von Rechtsbehelfen und Rügen ergeben sich aus § 160 Abs. 3 GWB. Soweit mehr als 15 Kalendertage nach Eingang der Mitteilung des Auf-traggebers, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, vergangen sind, ist ein Nachprüfungsantrag unzulässig."},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicOrderUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicPaymentUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"health","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"body-pl-la","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#0","values":[{"code":"prof-misconduct","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Eine vollständige Auflistung sämtlicher Ausschlussgründe sind den Vergabeunterlagen (Dok. 01b_Verfahrensablauf) zu entnehmen."}]},{"kind":"LocalLegalBasisWithID","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-LocalLegalBasisWithID#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vgv"}]},{"kind":"LotMainClassification","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotMainClassification#0","values":[{"code":"90910000","field_id":"BT-262-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"LotPlacePerformance","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotPlacePerformance#0","values":[{"code":"DE113","field_id":"BT-5071-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-5141-Lot","list":"country","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"LotProcurementDocument","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotProcurementDocument#0","values":[{"code":"non-restricted-document","field_id":"BT-14-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-15-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https://www.subreport.de/E65862233"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-708-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-140-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"E65862233"}]},{"kind":"LotReservedProcurement","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-LotReservedProcurement#0","values":[{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-71-Lot","list":"reserved-procurement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"ProcedureMainClassification","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ProcedureMainClassification#0","values":[{"code":"90910000","field_id":"BT-262-Procedure","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"}]},{"kind":"ProcedurePlacePerformanceAdditionalInformation","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ProcedurePlacePerformanceAdditionalInformation#0","values":[{"code":"DE113","field_id":"BT-5071-Procedure","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-5141-Procedure","list":"country","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"SelectionCriteria","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-SelectionCriteria#0","values":[{"code":"sui-act","field_id":"BT-747-Lot","list":"selection-criterion","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"UBL-SelectionCriterionName","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"(1)\tEintragung in einem Berufs- oder Handelsregister nach Maßgabe der Rechtsvorschriften des Staates, in dem der Bewerber niedergelassen ist,\n\n(2)\tBescheinigungen über die berufliche Befähigung der für die Leistungen verantwortlichen Personen (insbesondere der Objektleitung)"}]},{"kind":"SelectionCriteria","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-SelectionCriteria#1","values":[{"code":"ef-stand","field_id":"BT-747-Lot","list":"selection-criterion","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"UBL-SelectionCriterionName","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"(1)\tGesamtumsatz \n(2)\tBetriebshaftpflichtversicherung mit einer Mindestdeckungssumme\na)\tfür Sach-, Personen- und Umweltschäden je Schadensfall von 1,0 Mio. EUR und\nb)\tfür Vermögens-, Tätigkeits-, Mietsach-, Allmählichkeits- und Abwasserschäden sowie das Abhandenkommen von Sachen (z.B. von Schlüsseln) je Schadensfall: 0,3 Mio. EUR,\n(3)\tJahresabschlüsse der Geschäftsjahre 2021 bis 2023"}]},{"kind":"SelectionCriteria","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-SelectionCriteria#2","values":[{"code":"tp-abil","field_id":"BT-747-Lot","list":"selection-criterion","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"UBL-SelectionCriterionName","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"(1)\tMindestens 2 Referenzen \n(2)\tErklärung zur jährlichen Beschäftigtenzahl des Unternehmens und die Zahl seiner Führungskräfte in den letzten drei Jahren ersichtlich sind,\n(3)\tErklärung über die Einhaltung folgender Normen der Qualitätssicherung:\n-\tRAL GZ 903"}]},{"kind":"ServiceProviderParty","parent_section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","section_id":"ND-ServiceProviderParty#0","values":[{"code":"ted-esen","field_id":"OPT-030-Procedure-SProvider","list":"organisation-role","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-SProvider","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"}]},{"kind":"StrategicProcurementType","parent_section_id":"LOT-0001","section_id":"ND-StrategicProcurementType#0","values":[{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-06-Lot","list":"strategic-procurement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"Organization","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ORG-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-500-Organization-Company","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Klinikum Esslingen GmbH"},{"field_id":"BT-501-